                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This might be a good game but I'm not in the mood to find out after it crashed on me and took me back to square one. \n\nGraphics are okay for such an old game, moving around is very tedious though as the camera angels are a bit strange at times and the camera can't be moved (for example right at the start we're searching for our mobile phone but it's not possible to have a good look at the desk. The mobile phone isn't there anyway but still it's annoying to not be able to actually look around.) Sound and voice acting is good.\nSo if you get this to run properly it *might* be worth it's money - but honestly I'm just way too irritated to find out and just want to warn you that you probably will run into problems too.",
